# `target/` is excluded so a local tree of build artifacts -- gigabytes of it --
# never enters the build context. Issue #1051 needs one file back out of it:
# `BINARY_SOURCE=prebuilt` copies the release binary the pipeline already built
# instead of compiling it a second time inside BuildKit. The exception is the
# single file, not the directory, so nothing else follows it in.
target
!target/release/formal-ai
.git
ci-logs
docs/screenshots
